गणेरु, उस्, m. the plant Pterospermum Aceri-
folium [cf. कर्णिकार]; (उस्), f. a harlot, a whore;
a female elephant.

गण्डीर, अस्, m. a kind of pot-herb, described as
growing in watery ground, but according to some a
species of cucumber; a hero, a champion [cf. गण्ड];
(ई), f. the plant Tithymalus Antiquorum, = सोहुण्ड;
[cf. गाण्डीर.]
